        ["晋升之蛇"] = { mythicplus = [[{rt8}Ascended Serpent{rt8}||Immune to CC; [Infected]—spread, then group up for AoE after [Hatched Serpents] spawn; avoid the [Venom Vortex] wind ring and keep [Venom Spray]'s front cone away from the group.||{rt1}Must interrupt/kill fast: [Altar Edge]—random targeted, always dodge.{rt1}||Tank faces [Venom Spray]'s knockback outward; healer covers poison damage.]] }
